{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cc8763d41482a0ab","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \n\tI like it, too.","x":-500,"y":-63,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"56a45eb2d6212a78","type":"text","text":"answer 2:\n\tI hate this time of year.","x":-93,"y":-63,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2a9545233de40da4","type":"text","text":"start 1:\n\tWinter.\n\tThere was a heavy snowstorm outside the window.\n\tIt's like the white noise from a TV.\n\tI love this time of year.\n\tEspecially at night.","x":-285,"y":-340,"width":250,"height":242},
		{"id":"5ac41e5f66980d29","type":"text","text":"start2\nOh, come on.\n\t\tHow can you not like this weather?\n\t\tDoesn't this view relax you?","x":340,"y":-33,"width":250,"height":173},
		{"id":"b467aad3e8d7494a","type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nNo.","x":340,"y":260,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"298b1cd774236c07","type":"text","text":"start 2: \nOkay.","x":340,"y":443,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"88a5b675152a8e7e","type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nHurry up, it's gonna close soon.","x":-500,"y":817,"width":250,"height":123},
		{"id":"59b39462d4ee2509","type":"text","text":"road 1:\nAfter packing up I went outside, it kept snowing like that.\n\tIt's so beautiful at night.\n\tBut we have to go.\n\t1.\n\t2.\n\t3.\n\t4.","x":-285,"y":967,"width":250,"height":300},
		{"id":"da9301df3a3d07a6","type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nCome on, hurry up and get dressed!","x":-125,"y":560,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"73d579d71a160e0f","type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nI see you like him a lot.","x":-500,"y":560,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e0efd17772eb44a9","type":"text","text":"yes, it helps me relax and collect my thoughts.\n\nBecause if it wasn't for him, I wouldn't have remembered I had to go to the store.","x":-695,"y":680,"width":640,"height":100},
		{"id":"d98586730c2b2528","type":"text","text":"start 3: \nIt's so beautiful.\n\tI can't take my eyes off the snow.\n\tHe's so handsome.\n\tAnd there's so much of it.\n\tYou look at him and you think.\n\tI wish it would never end.\n\tLooking at him, I remembered my mom asking me to go to the store to buy groceries.\n\tI remembered!\n\tMy mom told me to go to the store!\n\tI'll be able to walk in this beautiful snow.","x":-285,"y":30,"width":250,"height":460},
		{"id":"cde42c7e96df38f5","type":"text","text":"start 4:\nYou're so mean!","x":-125,"y":849,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2082a41167a4a6ea","type":"text","text":"answer 1:\n\n What are you counting?","x":-285,"y":1360,"width":250,"height":90},
		{"id":"c01d1bd2687be007","type":"text","text":"I'm counting my steps.","x":-285,"y":1540,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"194305e1cd9a8798","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nBut, uh, why?","x":-285,"y":1680,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"94ba27f89de8cf04","type":"text","text":"I don't know.\n\t\t\tI've always done that.\n\t\t\t\tDon't stop me from counting!\n\t\t\t\tI kept walking and counting my steps.","x":-323,"y":1820,"width":327,"height":129},
		{"id":"82a1516954eaaa56","type":"text","text":"road 2 (next room and picture change road 2):\n187.\n188.\n189.\n190.","x":-352,"y":2020,"width":385,"height":160},
		{"id":"a5ca9645b83807fb","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nAren't you tired of counting?","x":-285,"y":2282,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5e67b8d9628429ea","type":"text","text":"No, I'm not tired.\nWhy do I take my meds every day?","x":-313,"y":2444,"width":307,"height":76},
		{"id":"53915cc2ae6b3dc1","type":"text","text":"answer 1 : \nWhat other medication?","x":140,"y":2452,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d69aec5f03cc6dd1","type":"text","text":"Mom, she gives me some pills to take every day.\nShe says it's very important.","x":420,"y":2620,"width":400,"height":80},
		{"id":"41ddc6d282c3033d","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nClearly.","x":800,"y":2452,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"de36899cce4073e8","type":"text","text":"How can it be clear if it's night and snowing?","x":800,"y":2280,"width":380,"height":60},
		{"id":"bf87c40218c7c2fb","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nHa-ha.","x":1365,"y":2284,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0313d6a434e25c61","type":"text","text":"What's so funny about that?\nAnd I forgot where I left off.\nI have to go back and do the math again.","x":1314,"y":2482,"width":353,"height":94},
		{"id":"677045cdaa2206f4","type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nJust go!!!","x":1560,"y":2700,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ee10c0a8b85ad0be","type":"text","text":"How rude you are!!!","x":1560,"y":2840,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0c575a303360e797","type":"text","text":"road 3 (change room and pictures road 3)","x":1340,"y":2980,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"230b608a385c15f9","type":"text","text":"road 3:\n472.\n473.\nYou know, I feel like I'm not just a person.\n","x":1340,"y":3140,"width":345,"height":120},
		{"id":"1069744e60b8a8ab","x":1159,"y":3367,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nand who are you?"},
		{"id":"52ea6f6a959f600e","x":1660,"y":3367,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2\nI don't care."},
		{"id":"a3b6f6f8805a4a2d","x":620,"y":3540,"width":438,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"It's like I'm a character in a game.\nA character in a visual novel.\nAnd you're the player on the other side of the screen\n"},
		{"id":"7946fd725cf9160e","x":403,"y":3787,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nThis is nonsence."},
		{"id":"9ef10dc7e5c10371","x":909,"y":3787,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nThat's the way it is."},
		{"id":"6e9c05750db58f0f","x":1017,"y":3938,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Oh, really?"},
		{"id":"c772a1d7718ee867","x":1017,"y":4093,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nYes."},
		{"id":"2369d8638fa242c4","x":1180,"y":4200,"width":341,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"Can I ask you a couple questions, then?"},
		{"id":"38431b13ad948de5","x":932,"y":4330,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nOf course!"},
		{"id":"1cc723f54b1aad1b","x":1440,"y":4330,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nWell you can ask."},
		{"id":"f8f1f99a31bd5a7c","x":1142,"y":4540,"width":341,"height":80,"type":"text","text":"You're a man from another world, right?\nWell, it's different for you."},
		{"id":"1ceeebf82b6cba1e","x":1188,"y":4726,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nUnfortunately, yes."},
		{"id":"e227dd3c3905a480","x":1167,"y":4880,"width":353,"height":140,"type":"text","text":"You'd like that, too, wouldn't you?\nTo be in a world like this.\nWhere there's no danger.\nThere is no fear.\nWould you want to be in a world like that?"},
		{"id":"b742a9763d28b495","x":1011,"y":5127,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nYes!"},
		{"id":"be6cc8e845189f99","x":1420,"y":5127,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nNo."},
		{"id":"a6a9c094fb0058ac","x":896,"y":5273,"width":448,"height":147,"type":"text","text":"I understand you.\nI don't know what I would have done if I'd been there.\nI'm fine here.\nThe main thing is that there is snow.\nDo you have?"},
		{"id":"2eea7771441cbe67","x":693,"y":5494,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nYes."},
		{"id":"dd5f54f3a45d2115","x":1219,"y":5494,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nNo.\n"},
		{"id":"89df3aacdda5a709","x":749,"y":5823,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\n473."},
		{"id":"897825dfd21f318f","x":749,"y":5996,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Right. Thank you."},
		{"id":"52dd08bda445842a","x":1700,"y":3567,"width":400,"height":93,"type":"text","text":"Why can't you listen to me?!?\nI want to talk to you, and you're being rude!!!"},
		{"id":"4f7a5b62804ad731","x":1775,"y":3748,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nI don't care."},
		{"id":"1ddd7c3befe44eaf","x":1775,"y":3880,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"I'm offended!"},
		{"id":"2d12e027fb831dbc","x":208,"y":4056,"width":412,"height":97,"type":"text","text":"Yeah, that's what I thought, too\nThen I wonder where you came from in my head?"},
		{"id":"294c1195dd54e988","x":177,"y":4302,"width":323,"height":88,"type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nWithout further ado, let's move on."},
		{"id":"a203a9583d4dd158","x":209,"y":4491,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Yeah, that's right, or the store will close."},
		{"id":"42de26c0124bdaba","x":969,"y":6720,"width":250,"height":80,"type":"text","text":"next room shop and change pictures \"Road 4\""},
		{"id":"9726d476be94c915","x":1438,"y":5273,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Why is that?"},
		{"id":"4df3ac9bfc703de5","x":1420,"y":5390,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nI can't answer that."},
		{"id":"344a721d2ca8deca","x":1380,"y":5590,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Okay."},
		{"id":"14660653421810ae","x":1080,"y":5700,"width":389,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"It's sad.\nWell, I can't stay long, the store's closing soon.\nWhat account did I settle on?"},
		{"id":"bebf21c00ba6be8b","x":618,"y":5620,"width":400,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"That's a good thing.\nWell, we can't stay long, the store's closing soon!\nWhat account did I settle on?"},
		{"id":"a2139a00ab622650","type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nI think you stopped at 190.","x":1159,"y":2780,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"660af59c90118847","x":965,"y":6912,"width":275,"height":248,"type":"text","text":"shop 1:\n1691.\n1692.\n1693.\nAnd here's the store.\nYou know, I'm glad I have you.\nI don't feel alone.\nAnd lost.\nThank you."},
		{"id":"f9dd06dd0cb323c9","x":977,"y":7280,"width":303,"height":120,"type":"text","text":"shop 2:\nI need to buy everything on this list.\nWell, that's all, I think.\nWe just have to find them now."},
		{"id":"3132792ff3eb0ac0","x":1006,"y":7486,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1: \nHelp is needed?"},
		{"id":"2b3bb5881a843f73","x":963,"y":7680,"width":336,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"No.\nEven though I'm sick, I can buy groceries."},
		{"id":"c9486afe90395cc7","x":1004,"y":7819,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nSick?"},
		{"id":"64fb127aa3a3efaa","x":1004,"y":7980,"width":396,"height":220,"type":"text","text":"I don't know, I guess.\nMom was on the phone.\nShe said I was sick with something.\nBut how did I not hear.\nMaybe that's why she's giving me the meds.\nOh, that's what I need.\nNow there's just a couple more things.\nIt's noisy in here."},
		{"id":"aff0f0fb7645591c","x":1620,"y":8060,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nit's a store."},
		{"id":"83b475497133a1aa","x":2012,"y":8064,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nIt's always like this here."},
		{"id":"f08ec00435bc913e","x":2019,"y":8302,"width":361,"height":98,"type":"text","text":"I know, but I still don't like it.\nToo many people and too much attention.\nWe've got to buy everything fast."},
		{"id":"48a6cc3411bb56be","x":1280,"y":7200,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"change room and pictures (store 1)"},
		{"id":"ea2bad74348c0d57","x":1020,"y":8474,"width":539,"height":286,"type":"text","text":"shop 3:\nExcuse me, girl.\nY-yes?\nСan you tell me where in here …..\nI-i-i.\nI-i.\nI don't.\nGirl, are you okay?\nI DON'T KNOW!!!!\nOkay, I'm sorry."},
		{"id":"322bc3c84108c4b6","x":1156,"y":8874,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"delete human"},
		{"id":"ec9106a98254bae8","x":1745,"y":8495,"width":495,"height":122,"type":"text","text":"change room and pictures (store 2) and add sprite (human)"},
		{"id":"c03525abc2174349","x":1164,"y":9079,"width":250,"height":121,"type":"text","text":"shop 4: \nanswer 1: \nWhy did you yell?"},
		{"id":"bee59458f320e8ac","x":1168,"y":9318,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"I was confused.\nHe looked so scary."},
		{"id":"755bb2815943949b","x":1171,"y":9463,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nWhat? No."},
		{"id":"e9b5f1bf80578c1f","x":1177,"y":9629,"width":343,"height":71,"type":"text","text":"All right, we gotta go even faster.\nTaking the basket, I ran for the last item."},
		{"id":"907befb1467cbeac","x":1640,"y":9649,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"change room and pictures (store 3)"},
		{"id":"0ee3d125fe8c2029","x":1644,"y":9824,"width":516,"height":196,"type":"text","text":"After picking up the last item, I ran to the cash register.\nNO!\nWhat no?\nNO!\nWhat no?\nNO!\nWhat no?"},
		{"id":"786199588f46a1ce","x":1782,"y":10096,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nGive her money."},
		{"id":"f9990162dad37080","x":1765,"y":10247,"width":355,"height":153,"type":"text","text":"Take.\nYes.\nWhat the hell was that?\nAs if this has happened somewhere before.\nOkey, never mind."},
		{"id":"1a6b127316519555","x":1805,"y":10504,"width":295,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"change room and pictures (road 4)"},
		{"id":"6240c3b44a649ec5","x":1837,"y":10664,"width":403,"height":116,"type":"text","text":"Walking out of the store I felt a sense of calmness.\nThank you.\nI was starting to panic.\nNow we can go home.\n"},
		{"id":"cfbe6058059a2d94","x":1902,"y":10880,"width":298,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"change room and pictures (road 2)"},
		{"id":"5958d6d678d6fcd0","x":1891,"y":11048,"width":309,"height":92,"type":"text","text":"You know, I write poetry, by the way.\nAnd I have a lot of them.\nDo you want to hear one?"},
		{"id":"5fc366ae67341e5d","x":1915,"y":11244,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nI'm listening to you."},
		{"id":"bef6f89c517a319c","x":1909,"y":11399,"width":531,"height":261,"type":"text","text":"Night is a happy time.\nWhen there is no sun, silence.\nAnd there's no fussing around.\nHow she disappeared without a trace.\nAs all anxiety disappears.\nHow sadness arises.\nAnd longing soaks up happiness.\nAnd doesn't give us time to sleep.\nWhat do you think?"},
		{"id":"c91542a5dd168532","x":1202,"y":11511,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 1:\nIt's beautiful."},
		{"id":"b07740df5c2270ae","x":2886,"y":11529,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"answer 2:\nHORRIBLE!!!"},
		{"id":"9ca36a847c1273b8","x":2886,"y":11680,"width":374,"height":55,"type":"text","text":"change room and full screen in color 0A101F "},
		{"id":"bddaee164a11e345","x":2924,"y":11840,"width":174,"height":100,"type":"text","text":"I passed out.\nI couldn't move.\nAm I dead?"},
		{"id":"0a862bf303e9c053","x":1202,"y":11700,"width":689,"height":580,"type":"text","text":"Thank you.\nI love the night.\nYou know, you look at it and you think.\nI wish this night would never end.\nYou want her to stay with you forever.\nYou want to stick around for a while.\nBut then morning will come.\nYou want to go back there.\nAnd you want to stay there forever.\nAnd you're thinking again.\nAnd again.\nAnd again.\nI wish this night would never end.\nNever."},
		{"id":"33e75fe73459d0d6","x":2051,"y":12560,"width":250,"height":92,"type":"text","text":"game end\nroom and pictures change (credits)"}
	],
